Minecraft content
-----------------
Some files in this repository, and in the resource pack and plugin jar built from it, are derived from
Minecraft. They are the property of Mojang AB and Microsoft and are NOT covered by the GPL:

- resource-pack-src/vanilla-geometry, vanilla-posed, vanilla-rigs, vanilla-animations and
  vanilla-blocks.json: model, animation and block data extracted from the Minecraft client.
- resource-pack-src/block-pack.json and texture-history.json: data generated from Minecraft's
  models, blockstates and textures.
- resource-pack-src/overlay: textures generated from Minecraft textures (armor trims, leather armor
  layers, emission maps, locator bar glyphs) and the armor shaders, which are adapted from
  Minecraft's shaders.
- Data generated from the above into the plugin jar (anim/, entity and animation catalogs, spear
  animation frames in custom-items.json).
- The built resource pack, which also contains unmodified Minecraft assets.

No Minecraft files are stored in this repository otherwise: the build downloads the official
client files from Mojang.

